  "question": {
    "text": "The moment of inertia of a cube of mass $m$ and side $a$ about one of its edges is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{2}{3} m a^2$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{4}{3} m a^2$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$3 m a^2$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{8}{3} m a^2$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0000_96bfdba5bedb.png\">\r\nFrom theorem of perpendicular axes, we have\n$\\begin{aligned} I & =I_C+m\\left(\\frac{a}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)^2 \\\\ & =\\left[\\frac{m a^2}{12}+\\frac{m a^2}{12}\\right]+\\frac{m a^2}{2} \\\\ & =\\frac{2}{3} m a^2\\end{aligned}$"
  }
}